		{"id":"03a9cc8338a59a8b","type":"text","text":"**Resulting `assets` document:**\n\n```json\n{\n  \"asset_id\": \"ca53ba5f-2ccd-4695-9a27-45836692b2fd\",\n  \"asset_type\": \"image\",\n  \"asset_subtype\": null,\n  \"title\": \"ring\",\n  \"business_category\": \"Ring\",\n  \"sequence_no\": 3,\n  \"identifiers\": [{\"id\":\"2db2d643-99e4-4914-bec5-56e773ca5ea2\",\"scheme\":\"internal\",\"role\":\"image_id\"}],\n  \"technical\": {\"mime_type\":\"image/png\",\"file_extension\":\"png\"},\n  \"status\": \"PENDING\",\n  \"storage_refs\":[{\"storage_id\":\"minio:bronze:ring/2db2d643-99e4-4914-bec5-56e773ca5ea2_3.jpg\",\"role\":\"primary\"}],\n  \"provenance\": {\"created_at\":\"2026-01-27T12:59:01.760Z\"},\n  \"observability\": {\"created_ts\":\"2026-01-27T12:59:01.760Z\",\"version\":1}\n}\n```\n","x":2220,"y":-620,"width":653,"height":501},
		{"id":"913ce1f40422e9ff","type":"text","text":"**Resulting `storage_objects` document:**\n\n```json\n{\n  \"storage_id\":\"minio:bronze:ring/2db2d643-99e4-4914-bec5-56e773ca5ea2_3.jpg\",\n  \"provider\":\"minio\",\n  \"storage_type\":\"object_store\",\n  \"bucket\":\"bronze\",\n  \"object_key\":\"ring/2db2d643-99e4-4914-bec5-56e773ca5ea2_3.jpg\",\n  \"uri\":\"minio://bronze/ring/2db2d643-99e4-4914-bec5-56e773ca5ea2_3.jpg\",\n  \"content_type\":\"image/png\",\n  \"asset_ids\":[\"ca53ba5f-2ccd-4695-9a27-45836692b2fd\"],\n  \"created_at\":\"2026-01-27T12:59:01.760Z\"\n}\n```\n\n","x":2920,"y":-620,"width":580,"height":501},
		{"id":"ff4be686b7a1d415","type":"text","text":"Knowledge Management PDF\n```json\n{\n  \"asset_id\":\"doc_a0af08a8\",\n  \"asset_type\":\"document\",\n  \"title\":\"sample-report.pdf\",\n  \"version\":1,\n  \"technical\":{\"mime_type\":\"application/pdf\",\"file_extension\":\"pdf\",\"page_count\":10},\n  \"status\":\"COMPLETED\",\n  \"storage_refs\":[{\"storage_id\":\"minio:kb-documents:documents/doc_a0af08a8_sample-report.pdf\",\"role\":\"primary\"}],\n  \"provenance\":{\"created_at\":\"2026-01-27T13:16:11.794Z\",\"processed_at\":\"2026-01-27T13:32:07.873Z\"}\n}\n```\n","x":2227,"y":33,"width":653,"height":467},
		{"id":"eb5692aaa8ee3f89","type":"text","text":"**Storage doc:**\n```json\n{\n  \"storage_id\":\"minio:kb-documents:documents/doc_a0af08a8_sample-report.pdf\",\n  \"provider\":\"minio\",\n  \"bucket\":\"kb-documents\",\n  \"object_key\":\"documents/doc_a0af08a8_sample-report.pdf\",\n  \"uri\":\"minio://kb-documents/documents/doc_a0af08a8_sample-report.pdf\",\n  \"content_type\":\"application/pdf\",\n  \"asset_ids\":[\"doc_a0af08a8\"],\n  \"created_at\":\"2026-01-27T13:16:11.794Z\"\n}\n\n```","x":2920,"y":33,"width":580,"height":467},
		{"id":"020f22af04371f85","type":"text","text":"Video preview image sample\n\n```json\n{\n  \"asset_id\":\"17c07396-f456-44ee-836a-bba7958eb3c3\",\n  \"asset_type\":\"image\",\n  \"asset_subtype\":\"preview_image\",\n  \"title\":\"cam06_preview_20260128_130418\",\n  \"identifiers\":[{\"id\":\"17c07396-f456-44ee-836a-bba7958eb3c3\",\"scheme\":\"camera\",\"role\":\"camera_frame_id\"}],\n  \"technical\":{\"mime_type\":\"image/jpeg\",\"file_extension\":\"jpg\",\"width\":1920,\"height\":1080,\"size_bytes\":289489},\n  \"storage_refs\":[{\"storage_id\":\"minio:camera-videos:preview/camera_id=cam06/date=2026-01-28/hour=13/cam06_20260128_130418.jpg\",\"role\":\"primary\"}],\n  \"provenance\":{\"created_at\":\"2026-01-28T07:34:25.219Z\",\"ingestion_pipeline\":{\"service\":\"video-ingestion\",\"version\":\"1.0.0\",\"host\":\"admin-ik\"}},\n  \"status\":\"UPLOADED\"\n}\n\n```","x":2227,"y":700,"width":653,"height":561},
		{"id":"0f1810bb9a2f5774","type":"text","text":"**Storage doc:**\n```json\n{\n  \"storage_id\":\"minio:camera-videos:preview/camera_id=cam06/date=2026-01-28/hour=13/cam06_20260128_130418.jpg\",\n  \"provider\":\"minio\",\n  \"bucket\":\"camera-videos\",\n  \"object_key\":\"preview/camera_id=cam06/date=2026-01-28/hour=13/cam06_20260128_130418.jpg\",\n  \"uri\":\"minio://camera-videos/preview/...\",\n  \"content_type\":\"image/jpeg\",\n  \"size_bytes\":289489,\n  \"asset_ids\":[\"17c07396-f456-44ee-836a-bba7958eb3c3\"],\n  \"created_at\":\"2026-01-28T07:34:25.219Z\"\n}\n\n```","x":2920,"y":700,"width":580,"height":561},
		{"id":"7560ceeebbd14f15","type":"text","text":"### Unified **Storage** metadata schema\n\n```json\n{\n  \"storage_id\": \"string\",               // stable canonical id (e.g., provider:bucket:path or UUID)\n  \"provider\": \"string\",                 // e.g., minio, s3\n  \"storage_type\": \"enum\",               // object_store|file_system|block|db\n  \"bucket\": \"string\",\n  \"object_key\": \"string\",\n  \"uri\": \"string\",                      // e.g., minio://bucket/key or s3://bucket/key or https url\n  \"content_type\": \"string\",\n  \"file_extension\": \"string\",\n  \"size_bytes\": integer,\n  \"created_at\": \"timestamp\",\n  \"last_modified_at\": \"timestamp\",\n  \"asset_ids\": [\"string\"],              // reverse-link: which assets reference this storage object\n}\n\n```\n","x":4720,"y":-160,"width":680,"height":560},
		{"id":"f5d6d180447b5a66","type":"text","text":"### unified metadata on data\n\n```json\n{\n  \"asset_id\": \"string\",                 // canonical UUID or business id\n  \"asset_type\": \"enum\",                 // image | video | document | audio | dataset | other\n  \"asset_subtype\": \"string\",            // finer grain (e.g., \"preview_image\", \"facial_recording\")\n  \"storage_id\": \"string\",                // ID of the storage metadata\n  \"description\": \"string\",              // business context for understanding\n  \"business_category\": \"string\",        // Business domain e.g.,\"Customer Support\"\n  \"sequence_no\": integer,\n  \"status\": \"enum\",                     // pending | uploaded | processed | archived | deleted\n  \"technical\": {\n    \"mime_type\": \"string\",\n    \"file_extension\": \"string\",\n    \"size_bytes\": integer,\n    \"width\": integer,\n    \"height\": integer,\n    \"duration_seconds\": number,\n    \"page_count\": integer,\n    \"format\": \"string\",                 // e.g., jpg, pdf, mp4\n    \"checksums\": {\"md5\": \"hex\", \"sha256\": \"hex\"},\n    \"quality_score\": number\n  },\n  \"provenance\": {\n    \"created_at\": \"timestamp\",\n    \"created_by\": \"string\",\n    \"ingestion_pipeline\": {\"service\":\"string\",\"version\":\"string\",\"host\":\"string\"},\n    \"processed_at\": \"timestamp\",\n    \"updated_at\": \"timestamp\"\n  },\n  \"observability\": {\n    \"created_ts\": \"timestamp\",\n    \"last_access_ts\": \"timestamp\",\n    \"last_evaluated_ts\": \"timestamp\",\n    \"version\": integer\n  }\n}\n\n```","x":5440,"y":-160,"width":820,"height":1040}
